 196:controller/utils/utils.h ****  *     Computes or accumulates the CRC-32 value for a memory buffer.
 197:controller/utils/utils.h ****  *     The 'inCrc32' gives a previously accumulated CRC-32 value to allow
 198:controller/utils/utils.h ****  *     a CRC to be generated for multiple sequential buffer-fuls of data.
